[2026-09-20 10:04:08.41987] [1110996] [debug] Processing line 9: <The docs here were copied from Google's Gemini, when I asked it how to generate a cpanfile>. token: 
[2026-09-20 10:04:08.41995] [1110996] [debug] Processing line 10: <**1. Manual Creation**>. token: 
[2026-09-20 10:04:08.42002] [1110996] [debug] Processing line 11: <* **Create a file named `cpanfile`:** This file will reside in the root directory of your project.>. token: 
[2026-09-20 10:04:08.42009] [1110996] [debug] Processing line 12: <* **Add dependencies:**>. token: 
[2026-09-20 10:04:08.42016] [1110996] [debug] Processing line 13: <* Each line in the `cpanfile` represents a dependency.>. token: 
[2026-09-20 10:04:08.42023] [1110996] [debug] Processing line 14: <* Use the following syntax: `require 'ModuleName';`>. token: 
[2026-09-20 10:04:08.42030] [1110996] [debug] Processing line 15: <* Example>. token: 
[2026-09-20 10:04:08.42036] [1110996] [debug] Processing line 16: <```perl>. token: 
